PokeJourneys Online

Based on PokeDaisy by Lidor Itzhari - https://github.com/lidor30/pokedaisy

The offline Battle Dome includes Pokémon Showdown via @pkmn/sim, @pkmn/randoms, @pkmn/sets, @pkmn/streams,
and ts-chacha20, under MIT licenses. Their copyright and permission notices are included in dome/licenses.txt.
https://github.com/smogon/pokemon-showdown — https://github.com/pkmn/ps

PokeJourneys is a modified version (a fork) of PokeDaisy. It keeps PokeDaisy's license, the GNU GPL version 3, and
the additional attribution term below. PokeJourneys' own changes and additions are Copyright (C) 2026 the Pokémon
Journeys authors, under the same license and term.

The rest of this file is PokeDaisy's NOTICE, kept as it is, followed by the components PokeJourneys adds.

